      "structure_description": "A discrete, centrosymmetric dinuclear complex in which two Eu atoms are linked by two phenolato O atoms from chelating–bridging PAN ligands. Each Eu is additionally chelated by two TTA ligands and has an approximately distorted square-antiprismatic coordination environment."
